WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Lumina K706 · MAP 110 · local NOAA Boston chart.
Captured 1 November; dataset accessed 3 October 2026.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Panning on the native touch surface.
Original speed with visible responses retained.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Zooming in and out with the app controls.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Rotating with two simulated touch contacts.
The chart is redrawn on the device.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.700
North up, a brief Layers workspace visit,
and back to the chart. No speed-up edits.
